  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-12-04T09:26:06.770Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I would suggest putting a small ring of colour around the new nametags at least. With the new VRC+ update, all usernames are grey and to check someone's rank you have to check everyone individually. It makes things a lot more inconvenient for one, because you can't tell what rank people are. Also, Trusted and Known user who have especially put a lot of time and/or effort into the game can no longer have that purple/orange name tag. It was a nice way of distinguishing players and also giving something to those who upload avatars/worlds or play a lot and have gained the trust of the game. It seems like with the new VRC+ update it is taking away those small things for a pay-to-win type of game, which is not what we want.",
